# Fast page flipping: 60 NEXT presses, 5 a second (audit AUD-002, 2026-11). The UI task handles the
# input that queued up during a waveform together and draws only the page the turns ended on, so every
# press turns a page and the wait after any press stays bounded (before: presses were lost and the
# panel caught up over five seconds and more).
@3s      tap   80% 56%        # 阅读 (favourite)
+2500ms  tap   50% 284dp          # 测试长书: third 108 px row
+3s      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+200ms      key   next
+15s     snap  drained
+500ms   end
